OL,3,GNEWSAAutumnal wildlife shots catch
OL,4,A'incredible' moments
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhotographers have been busy
OL,7,Fdocumenting wildlife as autumn draws in
OL,8,Fand wet weather nears.
OL,10,FThe first named storm of the autumn,
OL,11,FStorm Austen, battered parts of the UK
OL,12,Fwith severe gales and heavy rain on
OL,13,FThursday night, with further heavy rain
OL,14,Fdue across the weekend.
OL,16,FBefore the storm hit, Ashley Johnson
OL,17,Fwas out in Seaton Common near
OL,18,FHartlepool, where he had the
OL,19,F"incredible" experience of being
OL,20,Fwatched by a kestrel.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
