OL,3,GNEWSAAutumnal wildlife shots catch
OL,4,A'incredible' moments
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Natasha Roberts had a
OL,7,F"lovely encounter with a red deer stag
OL,8,Fand his family" near Hawkshead in the
OL,9,FLake District and Anthony Skordis said
OL,10,Fit was a "real treat" to see a pod of
OL,11,Fdolphins darting around at Roker in
OL,12,FSunderland.
